<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <body style="font-family: sans-serif; max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px; color: #1f2937;">
    <h2 style="color: #4f46e5;">💪 Hey <%= @user.first_name %>, time to track your protein!</h2>

    <% if @goal %>
      <p>You've logged <strong><%= @protein_logged %>g</strong> of your <strong><%= @protein_goal.to_i %>g</strong> goal today.</p>
      <p>You still need <strong><%= @remaining %>g</strong> of protein.</p>
    <% else %>
      <p>You haven't set a protein goal for today yet.</p>
    <% end %>

    <p style="margin-top: 24px;">
      <a href="<%= authenticated_root_url %>"
         style="background: #4f46e5; color: white; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;">
        Open Protein Tracker
      </a>
    </p>

    <p style="color: #9ca3af; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 32px;">
      You're receiving this because you have a Protein Tracker account.
    </p>
  </body>
</html>
